@Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5174

### GET All Vehicles
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/vehicle
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Accept: application/json

### GET Vehicles for specific Client
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/vehicle?clientId=8c242132-328c-4358-9f7c-819de32ffa7a
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Accept: application/json

### SEARCH Vehicles by string
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/vehicle?search=audi
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Accept: application/json

### POST Create Vehicle
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/vehicle
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "brand": "Toyota",
  "model": "Corolla",
  "licensePlate": "KR 12345",
  "clientId": "8c242132-328c-4358-9f7c-819de32ffa7a"
}

### DELETE Vehicle
DELETE {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/vehicle/aa53ebe4-157b-4615-8df4-c1e9b201106a
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}